{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/262","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/262/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/262/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/262/events","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/262","id":55278957,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU1NTI3ODk1Nw==","number":262,"title":"DASH Live Edge Calculation Erroneous","user":{"login":"bascel","id":10669613,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjY5NjEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10669613?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bascel","html_url":"https://github.com/bascel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bascel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bascel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bascel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bascel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bascel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bascel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bascel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bascel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bascel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":106814989,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDY4MTQ5ODk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"fc2929","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignee":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2015-01-23T13:01:43Z","updated_at":"2017-06-28T11:14:00Z","closed_at":"2015-01-26T14:50:34Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"In the current ExoPlayer version (dev branch), the live edge for dynamic DASH content is usually calculated as the media end time of that segment, which is the last one described by the DASH manifest. This last described segment is determined as follows:\n- (1) In case of a SegmentList, the last segment in the list is used\n- (2) In case of a SegmentTemplate:\n  - (2.1) If a SegmentTimeline is present, the last one described by the timeline is used\n  - (2.2) If the duration field is present:\n    - (2.2.1) The last segment in the current Period is used (determined using Period@duration or, indirectly as a default value, MPD@mediaPresentationDuration)\n    - (2.2.2) The index is unbound, if no info about the last segment is present. In this case, the MPD@availabilityStartTime is used for determining the live edge.\n\nFor most cases, this will always work fine. However, for case 2.2.1 (using Period@duration), this is no correct behavior:\nThe Period@duration and MPD@mediaPresentationDuration describe the total duration (including the future) of a period or a stream. Meaning, at MPD@availabilityStartTime + MPD@mediaPresentationDuration, the stream will end. A usecase would e.g. be live content, where you don't want to update the MPD. So in this case, the ExoPlayer would set the live edge as the end time of the stream (which might be in the past, present, or future).\nThe correct approach would be to use the MPD@availabilityStartTime as in case 2.2.2.\n\nMost simple fix i can think of is modifying the function getLiveSeekPosition in com.google.android.exoplayer.dash.DashChunkSource.java to always using the indexUnbounded==true part. (Note that this would apply the method also to cases 1 and 2.1)\n\nMore information can be found in the \"Guidelines for Implementation: Live Services based on DASH\n-IF IOPs\" on DASH-IF:\nhttp://dashif.org/w/2014/08/DASH-IF-live-v0.9.pdf\n","closed_by":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/262/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/262/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}